          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Reaiah the son of Shobal became the father of Jahath; and Jahath became the father of Ahumai and Lahad. These are the families of the Zorathites.",
      "ko": "소발의 아들 르아야는 야핫을 낳았고 야핫은 아후매와 라핫을 낳았으니 이는 소라 사람의 족속이며",
      "source_text_hash": "8f0563ce92ef872fd83ca963f0b0dbe4d7306cfc3b0c0f9087d8f605ea60082a",
      "translation_text_hash": "4710487b86ba8e044df1648506815dac6565b57f9a83413eca1a6b4a1fadc3f4",
