      "en": "They found rich, good pasture, and the land was wide, and quiet, and peaceful, for those who lived there before were descended from Ham.",
      "ko": "아름답고 기름진 목장을 발견하였는데 그 땅이 광활하고 안정하니 이는 옛적부터 거기 거한 사람은 함의 자손인 까닭이라",
      "source_text_hash": "b8a659c583b0b8440b99e2e117df68dae69d7a860d6beab1d771fbdbf7329423",
